#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
moodle - a terminal client for Moodle.

Talks to the same web service the official Moodle mobile app uses
(moodle_mobile_app), so it works on any site where the mobile app works.

  * no root / sudo needed      (install into ~/.local/bin)
  * no browser, no cookies     (logs in with username + password -> app token)
  * no third-party packages    (Python 3.8+ standard library only)

Run `moodle` for the interactive shell, or `moodle <command> [args]`
for one-shot use, e.g. `moodle todo` or `moodle sync all`.
"""

